---
title: Baked Fish
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Meat, Poultry, Fish
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@milk{1/4%c}
@salt{1%tsp}
@crushed corn flakes{2%c}
@fish
@melted butter

Mix corn flakes and salt. Dip @fish in milk, then the corn flakes. Put foil in bottom of pan and lay fish in it. Dribble a little melted butter on each piece of fish. Bake at 550 degrees for 10-15 minutes.
